# Build context for docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Allow-list: only what the build needs, so local secrets and caches never reach it.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!turbo.json
!apps/
!packages/
!docker/healthcheck.js

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.env*
**/dev.env
**/*.tsbuildinfo
